ers, fish, gather rare collectibles, hunt birds and more! Loot you find can be used to upgrade your character, buy a home and become a legendary hero! \n\n🐭 If you'd like to support us please like and favorite the game! 🐸","path":"/game/510411669-fantastic-frontier","slug":"510411669-fantastic-frontier","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/4d3699ed6467e70ad0d92188b3adeb752888303314cd865c5c649159610f6a60.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-3022e9059e4b4d7ae1e5507f1837d6b3/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":24,"visitor":35200430,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-05-19T11:06:11.095Z","creator":{"name":"Spectrabox","type":"User"},"script":{"count":3,"freeCount":3,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":2}},{"id":1240644540,"name":"Vampire Hunters 3","desc":"Balance patch v1.2r, 11/08/26!\n\nRumours of a dark uprising echo through the lands that an evil power is awakening from its slumber. There is a vampire disguised among you, slowly draining victims of their power to continue the eternal night. Join the vampire-fighting forces to eliminate all evil before light and day is merely a wistful memory.\n\nVampire Hunters is a murder-mystery game series where one vampire hidden amongst the survivors desires to kill all humans before night ends. The hunters are tasked with eliminating the vampires to save the survivors, but it's no easy task! Vampires are powerful humanoids, possessing strength, speed and powers beyond anything mortal... Keep your wits about you, stay prepared and work as a team to overcome this dark force of nature.\n\nThumbnails by w4dfu & Mozzhii\n\nTags: murder mystery, survival horror, action, deathmatch, teamwork, team based, werewolf, fps, shooter, tactical, first person","path":"/game/1240644540-vampire-hunters-3","slug":"1240644540-vampire-hunters-3","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/a6f72b06afa925cef9b331398fbe6fb7c6a94a83f756fc2c2d5f060e5eeeeec9.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-7a0929f4cec71a9a268c954fb